WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.690
Another Thing Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed to
Do At The Foundation: Dr. Bright has not "won

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:09.250
the internet" and is not authorized to declare
that any other individual has done so.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:13.670
Dear lord, Jack, do you have any idea how
dead this meme is?

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:18.400
If you continue to sully the Foundation break
room with more of this 9gag-tier humor, we’re

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.120
all going to team up, tie you up, and lock
you into a room with Able again.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.310
We are not bluffing, Jack.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:25.170
It’s dangerously cringe.

